Z||000000||Fiero*101||09-23-2001||01:13 AM||||My 86 SE 2M6 just doenst have PICK UP!<BR>I dont know what to do i thought getting a tune up would do it. But it didnt do anything when i push the pedal it goes but it just doesent get up and go like it should <BR>My sisters Buick Somerset has better pick up.<P>Any ideas on how to fix aceleration problems?<BR>Any info is good info.<P>thanks<BR>Fiero*101<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||09-23-2001||01:30 AM||||Open up the exhaust system. Hi-flow cat and muffler will help. Bored throttle body. Also, headers, improved ignition system, a 3.4L engine, a 3800SC, a V-8.<P>Speed is just a question of money, How fast do you want to go?<P>(Clogging catalytics will degrade the power over time. Once they clog they really run slow.)<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 09-23-2001).]||||reg||1
